of algorithms and code from OpenCV (https://github.com/opencv/opencv),
Copyright OpenCV team, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
Affected areas include (list maintained as the port progresses):
  - (pending) ORB feature detection      — modules/features2d/src/orb.cpp
  - (pending) pairwise matching + RANSAC — modules/stitching/src/matchers.cpp
  - (pending) bundle adjustment          — modules/stitching/src/motion_estimators.cpp
  - (pending) exposure compensation      — modules/stitching/src/exposure_compensate.cpp
  - (pending) graph-cut seam finding     — modules/stitching/src/seam_finders.cpp
